    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician upon Muth-labben, A Psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "א Aleph"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will praise thee, O LORD, with my whole heart;",
          "I will shew forth all thy marvellous works."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will be glad and rejoice in thee:",
          "I will sing praise to thy name, O thou Most High."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ב Bet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When mine enemies are turned back,",
          "They shall fall and perish at thy presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For thou hast maintained my right and my cause;",
          "Thou satest in the throne judging right."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ג Gimel"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou hast rebuked the heathen, thou hast destroyed the wicked,",
          "Thou hast put out their name for ever and ever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O thou enemy, destructions are come to a perpetual end:",
          "And thou hast destroyed cities; Their memorial is perished with them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ה He"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But the LORD shall endure for ever:",
          "He hath prepared his throne for judgment."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And he shall judge the world in righteousness,",
          "He shall minister judgment to the people in uprightness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ו Waw"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The LORD also will be a refuge for the oppressed,",
          "A refuge in times of trouble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And they that know thy name will put their trust in thee:",
          "For thou, LORD, hast not forsaken them that seek thee."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ז Zain"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing praises to the LORD, which dwelleth in Zion:",
          "Declare among the people his doings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When he maketh inquisition for blood, he remembereth them:",
          "He forgetteth not the cry of the humble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ח Het"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Have mercy upon me, O LORD; Consider my trouble which I suffer of them that hate me,",
          "Thou that liftest me up from the gates of death:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "That I may shew forth all thy praise in the gates of the daughter of Zion:",
          "I will rejoice in thy salvation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "ט Tet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The heathen are sunk down in the pit that they made:",
          "In the net which they hid is their own foot taken."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The LORD is known by the judgment which he executeth:",
          "The wicked is snared in the work of his own hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Higgaion. Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "י Yod"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked shall be turned into hell,",
          "And all the nations that forget God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "כ Kaph"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the needy shall not alway be forgotten:",
          "The expectation of the poor shall not perish for ever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Arise, O LORD; let not man prevail:",
          "Let the heathen be judged in thy sight."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Put them in fear, O LORD:",
          "That the nations may know themselves to be but men."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
